<title>USA: CCC seeks 11,650 tonnes U.S. soybean oil for Peru.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks 11,650 tonnes U.S. soybean oil for Peru.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it would tender February 11 for 11,670 tonnes of U.S. bulk crude degummed soybean oil under its export program to Peru.</p>
<p>The delivery period was slated for March 20 to April 5.</p>
<p>The CCC, which is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture, said the tender was for reply on February 12.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
